nTherefore, \n\n$$\n20{x}_{2}=20\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=4.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81104/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "15b92bed-c97f-5b87-9811-fbfc5c03314d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81104"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "2a34048a-175b-56e5-834f-5f9ef688a144" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "5ac362d8-bd18-5d68-9f2a-92f7f4048578" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "3bcf4d31-6408-582e-b8c3-21a1b2e0df2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "55c1c309-dd75-5c9a-8cee-dc946fbaa7f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "762055fc-438e-5f70-ae0f-22ffe3258e9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc5b1465-11dd-5e44-b855-e0ca6e43892b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-81141/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-81141/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-81141/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-81141/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-81141/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-81141/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-81141" :question/id #uuid "c992dc2c-cb54-59b3-b528-1c122228a4e4" :question/math-academy-id "q-81141" :question/problem "Given the **orthonormal** basis $B$ of ${R}^{3}$ and the vector $x$ below, find the value of $\\frac{1}{2}{x}_{1}$, where ${x}_{1}$ is the first component of $[x]_{B}.$\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{14}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{14}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{14}}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{35}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{35}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{35}}\\end{aligned}]},\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{10} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's denote the vectors of $B$ as ${q}_{1},\\,{q}_{2},\\,{q}_{3}.$ \n\nSince $B$ is an orthonormal basis, we have that $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]$, where ${x}_{i}=x\\cdot {q}_{i}.$ Computing ${x}_{1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =x\\cdot {q}_{1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{10} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}{x}_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-2)=-1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81141/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "39b12711-22c8-5cb7-bd61-e128734e7e6f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81141"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102320/selection/51c202a2848f